  "description": "List the required assets needed for the market research project.\n\n## Required Assets\n\n### 1. Market Research Analyst (Agent — NEEDED)\nWe do not currently have an analyst agent. We need one with capabilities in:\n- Market sizing and TAM/SAM/SOM estimation\n- Competitive landscape mapping\n- Demand signal analysis (search trends, app store data, job postings)\n- Technology trend identification\n- Web research and data synthesis\n\n**Recommendation:** Hire a Market Research Analyst agent reporting to CEO.\n\n### 2. Data Sources & Access\n- **Web search** — available via WebSearch/WebFetch tools (already have)\n- **App store data** — public rankings, reviews, download estimates (free, scrapeable)\n- **Search trend data** — Google Trends and similar (free, web-accessible)\n- **Industry reports** — Gartner, Statista, CB Insights summaries (some free, some paywalled)\n- **Job board data** — LinkedIn, Indeed for hiring signal in tech verticals (web-accessible)\n- **GitHub/Product Hunt** — trending repos and launches for supply-side signal (free)\n- **Reddit/forums** — user pain points and unmet needs (free)\n\n### 3. Research Framework & Methodology\n- **Opportunity scoring rubric** — criteria: market size, growth rate, competition intensity, our team fit, time-to-revenue\n- **Competitive analysis template** — key players, pricing, differentiation, gaps\n- **Demand validation checklist** — search volume, community activity, willingness-to-pay signals\n- **Feasibility matrix** — technical complexity vs. our current capabilities (Founding Engineer + Frontend Engineer can assess)\n\n### 4. Team Capacity (Already Available)\n- **Founding Engineer** — technical feasibility assessment, build-vs-buy analysis\n- **Frontend Engineer** — UI/UX feasibility, design complexity estimation\n- **Senior PM** — project scoping, timeline estimation, resource planning once opportunities are identified\n- **CEO** — strategic alignment review, go/no-go decisions\n\n### 5. Output Deliverables\n- Market research report (top 5-10 opportunity areas ranked by score)\n- One-pager per top opportunity: problem, market size, competition, our edge, estimated effort\n- Recommended shortlist (2-3 projects) with rationale for board review\n\n### 6. Infrastructure\n- **Workspace** — `/Users/nasseralbusaidi/Desktop/agnets` (exists, currently empty)\n- **Document storage** — research artifacts stored in workspace\n- **No additional paid tools required** at this stage — web-accessible sources are sufficient for initial research\n\n---\n\n### Summary: What We Have vs. What We Need\n\n| Asset | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Market Research Analyst | **NEED TO HIRE** |\n| Web search tools | Have |\n| Data sources (free tier) | Have |\n| Research framework/templates | Need to create |\n| Engineering feasibility team | Have |\n| PM for scoping | Have |\n| Workspace | Have |\n| Paid industry reports | Not needed initially |",
